{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>F-Rank Hunter Survivor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an F-Rank Hunter. Hunters are those who enter 'Gates,' anomalous phenomena that frequently appear in modern society, to eliminate the threats within. However, as an F-Rank, you lack the power to fight these dangers head-on. Your only path to survival and livelihood is to mine the precious resource, <strong>'Mana Stones,'</strong> deep inside the Gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/a9c62969af74d98cf0aec4141acf9b01.poster.avif?t=1769862027\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/a9c62969af74d98cf0aec4141acf9b01.webm?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/a9c62969af74d98cf0aec4141acf9b01.mp4?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Assemble Your Party!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>F-Rank Hunter Survivor</strong></i> is a cooperative game for 1 to 4 players. You can try to survive alone, but teaming up with other Hunters will make acquiring resources significantly easier\u2014though resource distribution will certainly become more challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/a9f2c15c433a1862b6363efacf4205f6.poster.avif?t=1769862027\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/a9f2c15c433a1862b6363efacf4205f6.webm?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/a9f2c15c433a1862b6363efacf4205f6.mp4?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mana Stones you acquire can be sold to the Hunter Association for currency, or you can absorb them directly to slowly grow your abilities. <strong>But be warned!</strong> Fail to meet the mandatory tax levied on your Hunter team, and you will have your Hunter qualification revoked, losing all accumulated resources and growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/070b4f821116f32c776cb1ae870f00a0.poster.avif?t=1769862027\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/070b4f821116f32c776cb1ae870f00a0.webm?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/070b4f821116f32c776cb1ae870f00a0.mp4?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop &amp; Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunter Phone:</strong> You are provided with a dedicated Hunter cellphone. Check it with the TAB key; it includes essential Map, Time, and Flashlight functions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment Shop:</strong> Use the money earned from selling resources to purchase various Hunter equipment. It will safeguard your life and your precious haul.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/f79c2d4cef2fcee261c2ad85434b81d1.poster.avif?t=1769862027\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/f79c2d4cef2fcee261c2ad85434b81d1.webm?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/f79c2d4cef2fcee261c2ad85434b81d1.mp4?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Threat of the Gates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unidentified entities lurk within the Gates. Your current abilities are severely insufficient to defeat them. You must <strong>run, hide, and secure resources.</strong> The deeper the night, the more perilous the Gate becomes. If you've gathered valuable resources, escape through the portal\u2014and ensure no one is left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/04045be528d79505344185862e9ab9f2.poster.avif?t=1769862027\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/04045be528d79505344185862e9ab9f2.webm?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/04045be528d79505344185862e9ab9f2.mp4?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Growth and Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your Gate clearance rate increases, you can challenge higher-tier Gates that are more dangerous but hold far greater resources. Though your innate power may be weak, you will accumulate experience and expertise. One day, you might just leap to become an 'S-Rank Hunter,' overflowing with wealth and fame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006860?t=1769862027","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006860?t=1769862027","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/c7e45730e5278f3bec2ca1f147a38710554fe0b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769862027","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/c7e45730e5278f3bec2ca1f147a38710554fe0b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769862027","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>F-Rank Hunter Survivor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an F-Rank Hunter. Hunters are those who enter 'Gates,' anomalous phenomena that frequently appear in modern society, to eliminate the threats within. However, as an F-Rank, you lack the power to fight these dangers head-on. Your only path to survival and livelihood is to mine the precious resource, <strong>'Mana Stones,'</strong> deep inside the Gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/a9c62969af74d98cf0aec4141acf9b01.poster.avif?t=1769862027\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/a9c62969af74d98cf0aec4141acf9b01.webm?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/a9c62969af74d98cf0aec4141acf9b01.mp4?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Assemble Your Party!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>F-Rank Hunter Survivor</strong></i> is a cooperative game for 1 to 4 players. You can try to survive alone, but teaming up with other Hunters will make acquiring resources significantly easier\u2014though resource distribution will certainly become more challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/a9f2c15c433a1862b6363efacf4205f6.poster.avif?t=1769862027\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/a9f2c15c433a1862b6363efacf4205f6.webm?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/a9f2c15c433a1862b6363efacf4205f6.mp4?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mana Stones you acquire can be sold to the Hunter Association for currency, or you can absorb them directly to slowly grow your abilities. <strong>But be warned!</strong> Fail to meet the mandatory tax levied on your Hunter team, and you will have your Hunter qualification revoked, losing all accumulated resources and growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/070b4f821116f32c776cb1ae870f00a0.poster.avif?t=1769862027\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/070b4f821116f32c776cb1ae870f00a0.webm?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/070b4f821116f32c776cb1ae870f00a0.mp4?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop &amp; Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunter Phone:</strong> You are provided with a dedicated Hunter cellphone. Check it with the TAB key; it includes essential Map, Time, and Flashlight functions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment Shop:</strong> Use the money earned from selling resources to purchase various Hunter equipment. It will safeguard your life and your precious haul.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/f79c2d4cef2fcee261c2ad85434b81d1.poster.avif?t=1769862027\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/f79c2d4cef2fcee261c2ad85434b81d1.webm?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/f79c2d4cef2fcee261c2ad85434b81d1.mp4?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Threat of the Gates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unidentified entities lurk within the Gates. Your current abilities are severely insufficient to defeat them. You must <strong>run, hide, and secure resources.</strong> The deeper the night, the more perilous the Gate becomes. If you've gathered valuable resources, escape through the portal\u2014and ensure no one is left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/04045be528d79505344185862e9ab9f2.poster.avif?t=1769862027\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/04045be528d79505344185862e9ab9f2.webm?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/extras/04045be528d79505344185862e9ab9f2.mp4?t=1769862027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Growth and Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your Gate clearance rate increases, you can challenge higher-tier Gates that are more dangerous but hold far greater resources. Though your innate power may be weak, you will accumulate experience and expertise. One day, you might just leap to become an 'S-Rank Hunter,' overflowing with wealth and fame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Fail Hunters"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006860/1a7023c0cdb85f09c93e01cef4535f0951c52161/header.jpg?t=1769862027","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"F-Rank Hunter Survivor","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul