cription":"F-Rank Hunter: Survivor is a 1\u20134 player co-op game where you mine Mana Stones inside dangerous Gates. Escape threats, pay your taxes, and grow from a powerless F-Class into a true Hunter\u2014alone or with your team.","steam_appid":4006860,"support_info":{"email":"ssmssm109225@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Ukrainian, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}